Trump's voter rallies in West Virginia, YouTube channel
President Donald Trump embarks a series of voter rallies tonight at Wheeling in West Virginia.
It's Trump's first out of five scheduled voter rallies next week, including meetings in Trump-friendly places like Tennessee and Mississippi.
While the vote on the affirmation of Trump's nominee for the vacant seat at the Supreme Court is suspended, Trump is trying to create support for the upcoming mid-item elections, because the republicans face a risk of losing control of Congress when the votes are cast in November.
When's Trump's voter rally in West Virginia tonight and how do you see it online?
Trump's voter rallies in Wheeling in West Virginia will be held at midnight (Danish time) the night between Saturday, November 29, and Sunday, November 30, 2018.
You can view Trump's voter meeting in West Virginia online via livestream on YouTube.
