The series and the way the energy apparently floats both to and from the wild audience shows that it's going to be the hardest to beat Sunday. And it would undoubtedly be very proficient if a potential European victory gets stuck by Fleetwood or Molinari when the sun goes down over the Le Golf National.
Prevails synchronously on their own holes.
However, it is too early to talk about European victories.
Bubba Watson and Webb Simpson made short process against Sergio Garcia, the morning all the way in the four-man duels as he formed a couple with Alex Noren.
